BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 641 Td (The widespread adoption of headphone listening has created an urgent need for accessible tools that) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 629.2 Td (convert standard mono and stereo audio into perceptually convincing binaural earphone output. This) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 617.4000000000001 Td (paper presents PlugSonic, a web- and mobile-based platform that enables non-specialist users to) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 605.6000000000001 Td (create, curate, and experience dynamic spatial audio narratives without specialised hardware or) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 593.8000000000002 Td (technical expertise. The platform implements a lightweight binaural audio engine that analytically) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 582.0000000000002 Td (synthesises Interaural Time Difference \(ITD\) and Interaural Level Difference \(ILD\) cues from first) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 570.2000000000003 Td (principlesusing the Woodworth spherical head model for ITD delay and a continuous first-order) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 558.4000000000003 Td (head-shadow filter for ILDto spatially anchor audio sources along the horizontal plane. This) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 546.6000000000004 Td (physics-grounded approach eliminates dependency on empirical Head-Related Transfer Function \(HRTF\)) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 534.8000000000004 Td (databases, removing associated spectral coloration artefacts for listeners whose ear geometry differs) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 523.0000000000005 Td (from measurement subjects. The platform further introduces multi-track spatial scene composition,) Tj ET
BT /TR 9 Tf 0.05 0.05 0.05 rg 66 511.20000000000044 Td (automatic sample rate harmonisation across heterogeneous audio stems, and phase-coherent) Tj ET
